          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@：攝取熱量減去估算消耗。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@. On pace. Finally, an order with some follow-through. Keep your next planned session; no need to double the order.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@. On pace. Finally, an order with some follow-through. Keep your next planned session; no need to double the order."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@。進度理想，這次有好好跟進！按計劃完成下一次訓練，毋須加倍追趕。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@. Target met. Look at you, actually delivering what you ordered. Enjoy the win; recovery is on the menu too.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@. Target met. Look at you, actually delivering what you ordered. Enjoy the win; recovery is on the menu too."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@。目標達成，你說到做到了！享受成果，也記得好好恢復。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@. You ordered results, but your target is still waiting for service. Book your next manageable session. The calendar does not accept excuses as payment.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@. You ordered results, but your target is still waiting for service. Book your next manageable session. The calendar does not accept excuses as payment."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@。目標還在等你行動，先安排下一次做得到的運動。月曆不接受用藉口結帳。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
